Six months on the road had provided me with plenty of opportunities to see a multitude of varied and interesting sights.  59 to be exact.  During my travels, most sight visits were not planned well in advance.  Rather, most were added to my agenda a day or two before arrival, sometimes just hours.  That's one of the things I loved about my trip, waiting to the last moment to set an agenda, and then having no pressure to keep to it.  I guess that makes me a flaky traveler?  I feel sorry for the next person who gets to travel with me, it'll be hard to shake off my uber-flexible agenda setting ways.
<p>
This was a difficult category to pick favorites for because so many great sights were seen in my travels.  The litmus test for selection was which sights immediately comes to mine when someone asks me for my trip highlights.  Problem is, depending on my mood at the time of being asked, the list is actualy different.
<p>
So, after some thought and reflection, here's the amalgamated list of favorite sights that popped out.
